N5008 [temp.expl.spec]/2, [unord.hash]: specializing std::hash for a user type
(the standard way to make it an unordered-container key) is written with a
qualified-id from outside namespace std.  CBMC previously ignored such a
specialization and used the primary template.  assertion.2 FAILURE proves
non-vacuity.
